# Prettier formats code here, not prose and not machine output.

node_modules/
dist/
build/
.dart_tool/

# Markdown is hand-authored and hand-wrapped throughout this repo, with compact
# `|---|---|` tables and `*emphasis*`. Prettier rewrites both on sight, which
# would turn every docs edit into a reformatting diff and bury the actual
# change. Neither design-system package runs Prettier over markdown either.
*.md

# NOTE — generated code is deliberately NOT ignored here.
#
# `packages/insolvia_tokens/src/tokens.ts` is generated, and it is still held to
# Prettier and ESLint like any other source. That matches what this repo already
# does on the Dart side: design-system-pr.yml runs `dart format
# --set-exit-if-changed` over the four generated token .dart files, and they
# pass. The generator is expected to emit correctly-formatted bytes.
#
# The trade is real and worth knowing: a Prettier version bump that changes a
# default can fail CI on a file no human wrote, and the fix is editing the
# generator's templates — never reformatting the output, which the drift check
# would immediately reject.

# The token source of truth. Its formatting is reviewed by humans and read by
# two generators; leave it exactly as committed.
packages/insolvia_tokens/tokens.json
